{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 42","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The centers of two circles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6cdde56f366d628a7a35826f98523dbe58bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> inches apart. The smaller circle has a radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches and the larger one has a radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches. \nThe length of the common internal tangent is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0ecc39eed474389ce9b32142f118e357a86c9fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 41\\text{ inches} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 39\\text{ inches} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 39.8\\text{ inches} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 40.1\\text{ inches}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ 40\\text{ inches}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e8731daebe13a53605a0de780cb4bc2def89b24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(400); draw((0,0)--(41,0)); draw((0,0)--(45/41,200/41)--(1645/41,-160/41)); draw((0,0)--(1600/41,-360/41)--(41,0)); draw(circle((0,0),5)); draw(circle((41,0),4)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,0),W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(41,0),E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(45/41,200/41),N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(1645/41,-160/41),SE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(1600/41,-360/41),E); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"215\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be the center of the circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be the center of the circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> be the common internal tangent of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4373e7b4be983c0315e82e1fda1df66ed34dd7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> past <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/28583280f0f3e63283217eb873dd073cb8847770.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}\\perp\\overline{AE}$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3c13699b4fc9352e8193ac633b3b6d78ec3ef32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}\\perp\\overline{CD}$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/e/00eb72310330c1b250648ac1f4412ff4ee986dfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}\\perp\\overline{CD}$\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/208eeb07928a5d764be9ca1d81d7a3f275308c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ACDE$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> is a rectangle. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d72aafb08b87801a9c220854f0b31cd3d7ccce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=DE$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d02e4429270ba27358a0d2886bb480fade9a673b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=AE$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Since the centers of the two circles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6cdde56f366d628a7a35826f98523dbe58bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> inches apart, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5ff84d3d3abe728e926e42dba4a273c12f2ab18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d7fb9c3293e210f840097c5038ce7a955b70f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE=4+5=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />. Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a> on right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd85454c0ce4000c0e63b4a1c4a12ef6f8b56e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba6c20e86f236a1c6c5364b6f271c1d05cfae2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=AE=\\sqrt{41^2-9^2}=\\sqrt{1600}=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"303\" height=\"19\" />. The length of the common internal tangent is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a790adb63dc16a61d4e74bec6699f46126033987.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 40\\text{ inches}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"115\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">Problem 41</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">Problem 43</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Proble